urants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","review_id":"XDk-HMWbSTrMNcUe2rU2OQ","date":"2019-04-04T20:18:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368091821670532,"text_excerpt":"Came here with my sister while on vacation. It was our last day in town and we figured we couldn't leave town without trying gumbo. We decided to come here after walking around a bit. We both got the chicken and sausage gumbo. I also ordered a side of fried alligator to try because I figured why not. We shared a side of cheddar grits because we both had never tried grits before, and I had a hurricane to wash it all down. First, our server was amazing, she was super friendly and down to earth, which made the experience nice. The food exceeded my expectations. It was all really good. I would definitely try it again."},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","review_id":"eQhoRYTIF2m3OBa_85c6LQ","date":"2019-02-01T18:44:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9321722984313965,"text_excerpt":"This past weekend, I set out to fully explore the French Quarter of New Orleans. About ten miles into my 21 mile day, I started to feel light headed and realized all I had in my body in the last 12 hours was tequila, it was time to eat. Gumbo Ya-Ya sits about a block from Jackson Square and is hard to miss if you're walking around the area. They have a nice patio with heaters and cloth napkins. The staff was really friendly and attentive, my server was La-La and she brought me several glasses of water and sweet tea without having to ask. I ordered the meat lovers taters because I wanted to continue my day and needed the carbs and protein. When my meal arrived, I was really very impressed...."},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","review_id":"KHyDi0g14CTXh2haInzA-w","date":"2019-07-01T22:32:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9305576086044312,"text_excerpt":"Had family and friends visiting from out of town. They wanted a good variety of New Orleans food. Walking the quarter we stumbled on Gumbo Ya-Ya in Jax Brewery. Sat in the patio and enjoyed the coming and goings Crawfish, alligator fried okra, red beans and rice. All the food was well done and very tasty. Everyone was very happy with their choices. The service was outstanding. Colleen did a wonderful job of keeping a party of 9 in food and drinks. Would recommend to all"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","photo_id":"0Xfsj8_-eOyQFbglkhmsEg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0Xfsj8_-eOyQFbglkhmsEg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8388861417770386},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","photo_id":"9FrLpwvf-SwuyXXtZa_VSw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/9FrLpwvf-SwuyXXtZa_VSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8165498375892639},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","photo_id":"jdo_CFBcOypdiDOjaaY3iw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jdo_CFBcOypdiDOjaaY3iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.816058874130249},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","photo_id":"ye6ApTHE5fd9wZHT0pv40Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ye6ApTHE5fd9wZHT0pv40Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8073574304580688},{"business_id":"GiE7HJbxwH7-xI52DR_UNQ","photo_id":"70J7-eAnCHgL-A0fQBf0lQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/70J7-eAnCHgL-A0fQBf0